              "segment": {
                "start_index": 637,
                "end_index": 793,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "The Stretch: Pressure Drop\nWhen you pull, bend, or press your finger to crack a knuckle, you stretch the joint capsule and pull the two bones slightly apart"
